  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "0922daa0-c4e9-4830-b54a-a134f4286b30",
      "title": "Leia a abertura e guarde as duas perguntas que vão guiar a compreensão.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6f1345dc-3109-4f5e-ba36-5fb664846954",
          "textContent": "<p>Esta aula parte de um contexto bem comum: alguém mostra fotos da família e faz comentários curtos.</p><p>Para entender rápido, faça sempre duas perguntas: <strong>quem é a pessoa?</strong> e <strong>qual pista física aparece?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "226edb46-293b-46cb-bfda-18892fd397f9",
      "title": "Olhe a foto, escute o áudio e acompanhe a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "dac94be4-ab6c-4082-aa37-e27c7e675b3a",
          "textContent": "<p>Veja, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>Mi hermana es baja.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Minha irmã é baixa.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/df55b5c8d0b2466bbf9589454fccd198_b02-mi-hermana-es-baja.png?Expires=1794099412&Signature=1ZoU5ymIPfswAQJV5j1zf82br9i8nvxM3Ymb8N4NOH6yRzJPrFpV0NBrVCYo5LDTqkv~F~TW7qJAdgOwgIgZ~Qb4RfvI9UM2Gl~apdrPEw3jFS3AqmxM-8jk307UEByerkiUAwxGBoNHuUiCA9LQfL7IoN4jgK9GQCLarFpgheIHWMjpGGuek9YrxM8K~vHQYPY9ZNhleI5MDyzzuZiTpOMIt4zxVEN7fc99ysFcHDc0x5h4tzhA0D1eJ42iOUCb09FRROQH3BfkQesYjI8CZGuNilVJiwOffivLHWZr0QF8nfr4af913ynBZxcZ2v-Sf-E8n-6r5CiY8hj-sMGNrw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fcc10330eb8c4612afc25a6288dc6b5a_b02-mi-hermana-es-baja.mp3?Expires=1794099412&Signature=QYZRsvuMcaooziQcTO8JWcN~SwUcvQ69j80bqOVW-bUKYhTaqDLPwldXaaOODwuxGOzmHZMc0SSRAww5QTvYy8t7zAwOeymQabvgK9frguq6YCkA7SeLSqLSPdSy6o-w1spB3v0p9CCek2~RWMsZfMJ-4BOj~aMhX1pKX0C5iUeVX~krMMSjWgZFoJ3uXjW~Bcgb5iKaIe~uPaI0MueOh3T0atVwIkxhU5ajjRtt9hOYwx0ql3CUNYq~b7UeW3nhjrL-tY2a9HDqK9hvkqN8o2v48LsJa50QyViq9U35ifmzIbIBXGCcfhLUbkE6P4kUiTPnpZ4nJDE4Bgry2zSjgA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
