    {
      "id": "8b492dd9-5cfb-4ff7-a82b-d83f1be29788",
      "title": "Releia a frase e observe o que responde quem é e o que responde como ela é.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ea2aa03e-b10b-458b-8fc8-0ddbbcd1c63e",
          "textContent": "<p>Na leitura, separe a frase em dois blocos.</p><p><strong>mi hermana</strong> responde <strong>quem é</strong>.</p><p><strong>es baja</strong> responde <strong>como ela é</strong>.</p><p>Esse hábito ajuda quando a descrição vem rápido.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bfca453e-3167-4aa2-ad57-6cdef10c08ee",
      "title": "Olhe o retrato, escute o áudio e acompanhe as duas pistas na mesma frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4201bc31-36eb-40c8-aa11-f8bc08a62e33",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a descrição traz duas pistas físicas conhecidas.</p><p><strong>Mi hermana tiene los ojos verdes y el pelo rizado.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Minha irmã tem os olhos verdes e o cabelo cacheado.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e616b0578e9b4a8eac86c0c2a76697e1_b04-mi-hermana-tiene-los-ojos-verdes-y-el-pelo-rizado.png?Expires=1794099412&Signature=UX0~wkYmLy~~hitMLCBF8yEOVnbX8a69CUW5En37U8ClCs5VNA2GWsj9csNuZqCd4DpkcHM~FLK-5vNz5jqKbcoodpyvuKAh0BN14va6ekPi4jgaU~8wqcZAucvRia9C-TJDmMcsyV3wIfx7uzP1VmeEOM7hwMsA7i~R83ma4n6hr6opZXlvdgCz1gkWZzG4oK5en7-tsGCpQWyuNYLtcLeThDF431Soiup7Ewtu-NaiEdoEtB5qqyBlSjytnwcq6WF3~LNAxfzWIP39F9XAZz90FNQ9AmWVqRCO4T071iZPxPIksCZH9tGeVw6pVasXhKAZDk6zDiA8mL-ArLvY-Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0fd8fe67ac324f77b56c83e8ee5667f4_b04-mi-hermana-tiene-los-ojos-verdes-y-el-pelo-rizado.mp3?Expires=1794099412&Signature=YMGIXXMfPtYv-OaT~zn285sDyNNFmDwmp-iRGk41ZEH49K8fe3L4-mMTTm8LhVK7tGZQb-ODJVIG3vB~WR5B5TMG9EhcZBzKAnC~Hbghv77aAPTiJrO-~cGF2l1q-I1qNOyo4eNAkq~iy6mKgwfQdDcuM~w1Bv6fzVjUF3acqHkYEyQ~CaZPYT1Zi6gTFhp1phwlWx2Uv-4qsJd9YQV-36Hu3WkuUFViCGUKUV7GTTZMNMN4u~vb0Rsia5UMDGx0pGPD4cGaTLlxaQRYb8TXzIPklLe9de69QzOcxmQGcFm1XFjgS59yI19cH6MzwkAxDn7Ozl4J5JnXP4GQ0BgcWg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
